    <p style="margin:42px 0 0;padding-top:18px;border-top:1px solid rgba(24,24,24,.2);color:rgba(24,24,24,.58);font-size:13px;line-height:1.6;">
        This article is for general information and is not medical advice. Changing marks, painful sunburn or persistent breakouts should be assessed by a qualified dermatologist. Patch test new skincare products, and check with a doctor first if you are pregnant, breastfeeding or using prescription treatments.
    </p>
